# Core Architecture
- Follow feature-first folder structure: `features/{feature}/{models,datasource,repository,logic,providers,ui}/`
- Keep business logic out of UI. UI should delegate to Providers/Logic.
- Prefer `Notifier` / `AsyncNotifier` over ad-hoc state.
- Repositories own data orchestration and enforce cache policy behavior.

# Services
- Core services must be singletons under `core/services/` (use service locator).
- Put platform-agnostic logic in repositories/logic; use services for cross-feature concerns.

# Isolates
- Use isolates only for:
  - large JSON parsing
  - heavy filtering/search
  - heavy sync processing
- Do NOT use isolates for simple async/network calls or UI logic.

